post_install() {
  cat <<'MSG'
==> emoticond: anonymous usage stats (which faces get picked, no id) are only
    shared if you say yes: you're asked the first time you run `emoticond`
    in a terminal, or decide now with
      emoticond stats on    # or off
    reports you make from picker menus are sent (emoticond reports off to stop)
==> data: install emoticond-data, or run `emoticond data fetch`
MSG
}
